# Deploy — production Odoo

Beats: **blast-radius tag -> {% if status_mcp == 'teams' %}notify start -> {% endif %}deploy on prod{% if use_queue_job %} -> requeue stuck
queue jobs{% endif %} -> invariant check (T+0; T+60 again for high blast radius){% if status_mcp == 'teams' %} ->
notify result{% endif %}{% if tickets_mcp == 'odoo' %} -> note the exact commands on the task{% endif %}**. Runs commands on the
**production** server — never acts without showing the exact commands and
getting an explicit OK first. Step numbers are fixed across projects — a gap in
them means this project does not run that step.

